    dmo:name "Glucagon-like Peptide-1 Receptor Agonists" ;
    dmo:weightEffect "Loss" ;
    dmo:evidenceQuote "These medicines, known as glucagon-like peptide-1 (GLP-1) receptor agonists,3 may make you feel less hungry and help you lose some weight. GLP-1 medicines are not substitutes for insulin." ;
