    dmo:drugClassCode "insulin" ;
    dmo:hypoglycemiaRisk "High" ;
    dmo:mechanism "Helps the body use glucose from the blood for energy and stores excess glucose in the liver and muscles." ;
    dmo:name "Insulin" ;
    dmo:weightEffect "Neutral" ;
    dmo:evidenceQuote "If you have type 1 diabetes, you must take insulin because your pancreas does not make it." ;
    dmo:evidenceQuote "You can give yourself insulin shots using a needle and syringe. You draw up your dose of insulin from the vial—or bottle—through the needle into the syringe." ;
