    dmo:recommendationStrength "Strong" ;
    dmo:recommendationType "Treatment" ;
    dmo:statement "If you have type 1 diabetes, you must take insulin because your pancreas does not make it. You will need to take insulin several times during the day, including when you eat and drink, to control your blood glucose level." ;
    dmo:evidenceQuote "If you have type 1 diabetes, you must take insulin because your pancreas does not make it. You will need to take insulin several times during the day, including when you eat and drink, to control your blood glucose level." ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://example.org/dmo/id/guidelineSource/niddk-insulin-medicines-treatments> .

